ate’s reportable disease database and searching records obtained during outbreak investigations.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"was evaluated using detailed notes from public health investigations\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"First, case counts were based on surveillance data and might be subject to small discrepancies.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"a comparison before and after implementation of the revised requirements was not possible\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\", \"outcome_types\"]}", "type": "text"}]}